TI  - Fifteen years of ChEMBL and its role in cheminformatics and drug discovery.
PG  - 32
LID - 10.1186/s13321-025-00963-z [doi]
LID - 32
AB  - In October 2024 we celebrated the 15th anniversary of the first launch of ChEMBL, 
      Europe's most impactful, open-access drug discovery database, hosted by EMBL's 
      European Bioinformatics Institute (EMBL-EBI). This is a good moment to reflect on 
      ChEMBL's history, the role that ChEMBL plays in Cheminformatics and Drug 
      Discovery as well as innovations accelerated using data extracted from it. The 
      review closes by discussing current challenges and possible directions that need 
      to be taken to guarantee that ChEMBL continues to be the pioneering resource for 
      highly curated, open bioactivity data on the European continent and beyond.
