TI  - ChemDoodle Web Components: HTML5 toolkit for chemical graphics, interfaces, and 
      informatics.
PG  - 35
LID - 10.1186/s13321-015-0085-3 [doi]
LID - 35
AB  - ChemDoodle Web Components (abbreviated CWC, iChemLabs, LLC) is a light-weight 
      (~340 KB) JavaScript/HTML5 toolkit for chemical graphics, structure editing, 
      interfaces, and informatics based on the proprietary ChemDoodle desktop software. 
      The library uses <canvas> and WebGL technologies and other HTML5 features to 
      provide solutions for creating chemistry-related applications for the web on 
      desktop and mobile platforms. CWC can serve a broad range of scientific 
      disciplines including crystallography, materials science, organic and inorganic 
      chemistry, biochemistry and chemical biology. CWC is freely available for 
      in-house use and is open source (GPL v3) for all other uses.Graphical abstractAdd 
      interactive 2D and 3D chemical sketchers, graphics, and spectra to websites and 
      apps with ChemDoodle Web Components.
