TI  - ErtlFunctionalGroupsFinder: automated rule-based functional group detection with 
      the Chemistry Development Kit (CDK).
PG  - 37
LID - 10.1186/s13321-019-0361-8 [doi]
LID - 37
AB  - The Ertl algorithm for automated functional groups (FG) detection and extraction 
      of organic molecules is implemented on the basis of the Chemistry Development Kit 
      (CDK). A distinct impact of the chosen CDK aromaticity model is demonstrated by 
      an FG analysis of the ChEMBL database compounds. The average performance of less 
      than a millisecond for a single-molecule FG extraction allows for fast processing 
      of even large compound databases.
