AB  - OriginLab's newest version update to Origin and OriginPro includes ease-of-use 
      features, like Origin Central updates and creation of an App Center, as well as 
      larger changes like the addition of Unicode characters, alteration to how user 
      files are stored and visually searched, and user input formula in cells within 
      worksheets. These features add additional value to an already powerful data 
      analysis and plotting software package.
