TI  - Rapid prediction of NMR spectral properties with quantified uncertainty.
PG  - 50
LID - 10.1186/s13321-019-0374-3 [doi]
LID - 50
AB  - Accurate calculation of specific spectral properties for NMR is an important step 
      for molecular structure elucidation. Here we report the development of a novel 
      machine learning technique for accurately predicting chemical shifts of both 
      [Formula: see text]   and [Formula: see text] nuclei which exceeds DFT-accessible 
      accuracy for [Formula: see text] and [Formula: see text] for a subset of nuclei, 
      while being orders of magnitude more performant. Our method produces estimates of 
      uncertainty, allowing for robust and confident predictions, and suggests future 
      avenues for improved performance.
