TI  - International chemical identifier for reactions (RInChI).
PG  - 22
LID - 10.1186/s13321-018-0277-8 [doi]
LID - 22
AB  - The Reaction InChI (RInChI) extends the idea of the InChI, which provides a 
      unique descriptor of molecular structures, towards reactions. Prototype versions 
      of the RInChI have been available since 2011. The first official release 
      (RInChI-V1.00), funded by the InChI Trust, is now available for download ( 
      http://www.inchi-trust.org/downloads/ ). This release defines the format and 
      generates hashed representations (RInChIKeys) suitable for database and web 
      operations. The RInChI provides a concise description of the key data in chemical 
      processes, and facilitates the manipulation and analysis of reaction data.
